## 🚀 Database Management Scripts

### Setup Commands (Initial)
```bash
# First-time database setup với Apple Silicon support
./scripts/setup/db/setup-database.sh --default

# Comprehensive setup với auto-detection
./scripts/start-database.sh --full-default-setup
```

### Daily Operations với New Scripts
```bash
# Quick database start
./scripts/start-database.sh

# Component-specific database operations
./scripts/utils/db/start-db.sh           # Start database container
./scripts/utils/db/stop-db.sh            # Stop database container  
./scripts/utils/db/restart-db.sh         # Restart container
./scripts/utils/db/reset-db.sh           # Reset database với confirmation
./scripts/utils/db/delete-db.sh          # Delete container với confirmation

# Network management
