```

### Comprehensive Health Monitoring
```bash
# Advanced health check với detailed reports
./scripts/utils/db/db-health-check.sh

# Health check outputs:
# - Connection tests for all users (sa, app_user, role users)
# - Database information (version, size)
# - SQL Server logins và status
# - Database users và roles
# - Permissions matrix
# - Tables với row counts
# - Database objects summary
```

### Direct SQL Execution với Environment
```bash
# Load environment trước khi execute SQL
source scripts/utils/config-loader.sh
load_env_file

# Execute SQL với environment variables
docker exec $DB_CONTAINER_NAME /opt/mssql-tools18/bin/sqlcmd \
    -S localhost \
    -U sa \
    -P "$MSSQL_SA_PASSWORD" \
    -C \
    -d "$DB_NAME" \
    -i "/path/to/script.sql" \
    -v QLDSV_DB_NAME="$DB_NAME" \
    -v QLDSV_APP_USER="$MSSQL_APP_USER"
```

