fi
```

## ❌ Anti-Patterns to Avoid với New Scripts
```bash
# ❌ Wrong: Direct Docker commands
docker run -p 1434:1433 mcr.microsoft.com/mssql/server

# ✅ Right: Use script utilities
./scripts/utils/db/start-db.sh

# ❌ Wrong: Manual database reset
docker stop container && docker rm container

# ✅ Right: Use reset script với confirmation
./scripts/utils/db/reset-db.sh

# ❌ Wrong: Skip environment loading
sqlcmd -S localhost -U sa -P hardcoded_password

# ✅ Right: Use config loader
source scripts/utils/config-loader.sh
load_env_file
docker exec $DB_CONTAINER_NAME /opt/mssql-tools18/bin/sqlcmd \
    -S localhost -U sa -P "$MSSQL_SA_PASSWORD"
```

## 🔍 Debug & Monitor với New Architecture

### Debug Workflow
1. **Health check first**: `./scripts/utils/db/db-health-check.sh`
2. **Check container status**: `docker ps | grep qldsv`
3. **View container logs**: `docker logs $DB_CONTAINER_NAME`
4. **PRINT statements** trong stored procedures cho detailed logs
5. **Script output** với progress indicators và validation

### Performance Analysis
```sql
-- Still use SET STATISTICS trong SQL
SET STATISTICS IO ON;
SET STATISTICS TIME ON;

-- Your query here

SET STATISTICS IO OFF;
SET STATISTICS TIME OFF;
```

### Troubleshooting Commands
```bash
# Container issues
./scripts/utils/db/restart-db.sh

# Data corruption
./scripts/utils/db/reset-db.sh     # Requires user confirmation

# Complete rebuild
./scripts/utils/db/delete-db.sh    # Requires user confirmation
./scripts/setup/db/setup-database.sh --default
```

